sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Handler as PlanRemoteItemsHandler<br/>internal/command/plan_remote_items.go
    participant Service as service.RemotePlanner<br/>internal/service/remote_planner.go
    participant Adapter as todoapi.Client<br/>internal/infrastructure/client/todoapi/todoapi.go
    participant Client as httpclient.Client<br/>internal/infrastructure/client/core/httpclient/client.go
    participant API as Todo API, or with TODO_API_HOST=mock its emulator<br/>internal/infrastructure/client/todoapi/mock/todoapi_mock.go

    Handler->>+Service: Plan(ctx, titles)
    Service->>+Adapter: PlanItems(ctx, titles)
    Adapter->>+Client: Call(ctx, POST, path, request, &answer)
    Note over Client: the operation is in the adapter's list, the client middleware run around each attempt
    Note over Client: record "http client request sent"
    Client->>+API: POST /v1/items/plan, JSON, X-Request-Id, within TODO_API_TIMEOUT
    API-->>-Client: answer, or none
    Note over Client: record "http client response received"
    Client-->>-Adapter: answer, or outcome.ErrUnavailable, or outcome.StatusError
    Adapter-->>-Service: []todoapi.Item, or the outcome
    Note over Service: ErrUnavailable: entity.ErrUnavailable. Code INVALID_ARGUMENT: entity.ErrInvalid. Anything else: no kind
    Service-->>-Handler: []entity.Item, or an error
